@DocumentRagSystem.WebApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5196

### Health Check
GET {{DocumentRagSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Get All Documents
GET {{DocumentRagSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/documents
Accept: application/json

### Check Document Status (Query Parameter)
GET {{DocumentRagSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/documents/status?fileName=sample.pdf
Accept: application/json

### Check Document Status (Route Parameter)
GET {{DocumentRagSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/documents/status/sample.pdf
Accept: application/json

### Check Document Status (Resource Route Parameter)
GET {{DocumentRagSystem.WebApi_HostAddress}}/api/documents/sample.pdf/status
Accept: application/json
